.TH snip-keys-list 1  "snip 0.5.5" 
.SH NAME
snip\-keys\-list \- List effective bindings, grouped by mode
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnip keys list\fR [\fB\-\-library\fR] [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List effective bindings, grouped by mode
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-library\fR \fI<LIBRARY>\fR
Library root. Falls back to SNIP_LIBRARY, ancestor discovery, then config
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<MODE>\fR
Restrict output to one mode
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
global
.IP \(bu 2
sidebar
.IP \(bu 2
list
.IP \(bu 2
preview
.IP \(bu 2
fragment
.IP \(bu 2
fragment\-grab
.IP \(bu 2
trash
.IP \(bu 2
help
.IP \(bu 2
git
.IP \(bu 2
gist
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Structured output mode for commands that return records
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
human
.IP \(bu 2
json
.IP \(bu 2
jsonl
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<COLOR>\fR
Color policy for terminal preview
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
